--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

code/feedforward/ and code/splat/ contain code derived from MVSplat
(https://github.com/donydchen/mvsplat), distributed under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2024 Donny Chen.

The 3D Gaussian Splatting rasteriser used by this project and part of the
scene/rendering utilities originate from INRIA's gaussian-splatting
(https://github.com/graphdeco-inria/gaussian-splatting), distributed under a
non-commercial research license. Review those terms before any commercial use.

The radio radiance field formulation and the base RF dataset follow RF-3DGS
(https://github.com/SunLab-UGA/RF-3DGS); see that repository for its terms.

The NIST lobby digital twin scene used to generate the spectra is distributed
by its original authors and is not included here.
